e, |cffffff331|r Shock Damage, or |cffffff331|r Frost Damage every |cffffff1|r second, which increases by |cffffff1|r% each time it deals damage, up to |cffffff20|r%. This effect can occur once every |cffffff10|r seconds, and scales off the higher of your Weapon or Spell Damage."}]}
